    reg {
        name = "SENSE output clock configuration register";
        desc = "PERI_CRG39 is the SENSE output clock configuration register.

Despite the register title, bit 3 powers down the PCIE PHY (data sheet 3.10.4: write 1 to switch it off). sense_cksel is the clock the SoC outputs to the image sensor. The data sheet lists 27 MHz twice (010 and 101); low confidence which entry is wrong.

Data sheet 3.2.5 PERI_CRG39 (offset 0x9C, printed page 3-54, `hi3516v100--Hi3516-Datasheet.txt` line 12306).";

