PLL lock status; must be 1 before the system may switch to NORMAL (PLL) mode. The vendor U-Boot header arch-hi3520d/platform.h defines this register at 0xAC with mask 0xF (REG_CRG43_OFFSET / REG_CRG43_MASK; unused Hi3516-template leftover). The summary table row of the data sheet wraps the offset (`0x000000 / AC`); the block header says 0x00AC.

Data sheet 3.2.5 PERI_CRG43 (offset 0xAC, printed page 3-55, `hi3516v100--Hi3516-Datasheet.txt` line 12385).";

        enum PERI_CRG43_epll_lock_enum {
